O9810 (PROTECTED POSITIONING - CNC TWIN BUILT-IN PROBE MACRO)
(X Y Z: TARGET IN WORK COORDINATES, AXES NOT GIVEN STAY; F: FEED. THE MOVE IS A SKIP MOVE:)
(A PROBE TRIGGER ON THE WAY STOPS IT AND RAISES PATH OBSTRUCTED)
#30 = #4003
#31 = #{f_var}
#32 = 1.
IF [#4006 EQ 20] THEN #32 = 25.4
IF [#9 EQ #0] THEN #9 = {fast_feed_mm_min} / #32
IF [#24 EQ #0] THEN #24 = #5001
IF [#25 EQ #0] THEN #25 = #5002
IF [#26 EQ #0] THEN #26 = #5003
G90 G31 X#24 Y#25 Z#26 F#9
#10 = ABS[#5061 - #24] + ABS[#5062 - #25] + ABS[#5063 - #26]
IF [#10 GE {count_mm} / #32] GOTO 90
G#30 F#31
M99
N90 #3000 = {alarm_obstructed} (PATH OBSTRUCTED)
M99
